From: Zizheng Guo <gzz_2000@126.com>
Subject: [PATCH] tgsi: count sanity errors whether they are printed or not

tgsi_sanity_check returns whether the tokens have no errors, but
report_error counted an error only if TGSI_PRINT_SANITY had it printed:
without it, every shader passed. TTC's GPU renderer checks the TGSI that
guests send before it gives it to Zink, whose tgsi_to_nir dereferences the
declarations of the registers that a shader uses.

